  "item_description": "Lines per folio: 9; 7 on fol. 13a.\r\nNumbering of folios in numerals on fols. 2\u20134 and in letters on fols. 5\u201312 (preceded by an illegible character on 5 and 5, maybe a numeral?) on the recto of the folios.\r\nOrthography:\r\n-  Extensive use of abbreviations (e.g., for thun mong, shes rab, 'jig rten, bdag nyid, phun sum tshogs etc.) (number increasing as the text goes)\r\n- Numerals used for numbers and for phonetic value (e.g., 4+n for bzhin)\r\n- \u1e47a for med\r\n- Additional b- prefixes (e.g., bsgrub, bston)\r\n- Alternative prefix b- for g- (e.g., rnam par bzhag pa)\r\nA few interlinear corrections and some glosses (e.g., fol. 4b9), in two different hands."
